Package: bitbloq-offline
Version: 1.3.0-rc.1
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Eduardo Millán <eduardo.millan@bitbloq.local>
Description: Bitbloq Offline - visual programming for Arduino, Zowi and PrintBot.
 Bitbloq Offline is the desktop application that lets you program boards
 (Arduino, Zowi, PrintBot, etc.) with a visual block editor. It bundles
 Web2Board, the service that compiles and flashes programs over USB.
 Homepage: https://github.com/eduardomillan/bitbloq-offline-24
